# Allow-list: ignore everything, then re-include only what belongs in the repo.
# (Keeps game data, build output and the exe out of git. The exe goes in GitHub Releases.)
*

!.gitignore
!README*.md
!LICENSE
!requirements.txt
!PrincessMakerTool.py
!build.bat

# If you add a new file to the repo later (an icon, a screenshot, ...),
# add a matching "!filename" line above, otherwise git will ignore it.
